oundary $∂A$ are shown below.\n\n![](images/0a/0a0b92621d83d6395926a75b5cae34f479a8b9e64dfe82711094c3724b3b3220.png)\n\nThe interior of a set $A,$ denoted $\\text{int}\\,A,$ is the set containing all the interior points of $A.$ It contains every point in $A$ except the boundary points: \n\n$$\n\\text{int}\\,A=A-∂A\n$$\n\nThe interior of $A$ is shown below.\n\n![](images/3d/3ddef68bf4b4284c1b68896920fddb8d7fb0e70eba15dee103cdbc0134a9ed20.png)\n\nSo, in this case, the interior of $A$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\text{int}\\,A={(x,y)\\in {R}^{2}\\,:\\,0<x<2,\\,-x<y<x}.\n$$" 13194139534776 17592186045417 false] [17592186435680 1080 "y<2-x" 13194139534776 17592186045417 true] [17592186435680 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139534776 17592186045417 true] [17592186435680 1083 #uuid "12dc85bb-cd47-5b33-a127-8e0086b71833" 13194139534776 17592186045417 true] [17592186435681 1080 "y>2-x" 13194139534776 17592186045417 true] [17592186435681 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139534776 17592186045417 true] [17592186435681 1083 #uuid "4abb66be-2678-58be-a9b9-2a2311d4b784" 13194139534776 17592186045417 true] [17592186435682 1080 "y\\le 2-x" 13194139534776 17592186045417 true] [17592186435682 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139534776 17592186045417 true] [17592186435682 1083 #uuid "4f38e133-dcd8-5339-a2b7-5a9997c0d1f0" 13194139534776 17592186045417 true] [17592186435683 1080 "y\\ge 2-x" 13194139534776 17592186045417 true] [17592186435683 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139534776 17592186045417 true] [17592186435683 1083 #uuid "6dc57868-eec7-5486-9156-13dad63ee061" 13194139534776 17592186045417 true] [17592186435684 1080 "y=2-x" 13194139534776 17592186045417 true] [17592186435684 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139534776 17592186045417 true] [17592186435684 1083 #uuid "db118f09-f7c6-5463-ab93-b46db354c131" 13194139534776 17592186045417 true] [17592186435685 1075 #edb/ref 17592186435680 13194139534776 17592186045417 true] [17592186435685 1075 #edb/ref 17592186435681 13194139534776 1759